      "created_at": "2022-05-18T08:50:00.295Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi</p>\n<p>I am unable to add options into a Select field, namely Reason, in Customize Form for Attendance Request in HR module. Screenshots are given below. Though I could find couple of posts on this topic the solution did not seem comprehensive. Is there another way to resolve the issue. Please help.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/5/55af793db2a949a943af353e4e9cace0aa31ea5f.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/55af793db2a949a943af353e4e9cace0aa31ea5f\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/5/55af793db2a949a943af353e4e9cace0aa31ea5f_2_690x348.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"ce0xcdI7l4MUvtJvnaq7jOSbmZV\" width=\"690\" height=\"348\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/5/55af793db2a949a943af353e4e9cace0aa31ea5f_2_690x348.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/5/55af793db2a949a943af353e4e9cace0aa31ea5f_2_1035x522.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/5/55af793db2a949a943af353e4e9cace0aa31ea5f.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9FAFA\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1193×603 37.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/6/f6df391130ae88500c5b5186ba20b9aec61e19a1.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"zdVI3EuUeZTgEx0ngGQK6dNfeJb\" width=\"576\" height=\"118\"></p>",
